  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut zucchini and red capsicum into bite-sized chunks. Cut carrot into half-moons.\n• Place veggies on the lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper.\n• Toss to coat and roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/624511c1ee96c91263062672/step-ecf27508.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/624511c1ee96c91263062672/step-4b6d3ba2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice the onion.\n• In a frying pan, heat a drizzle of oil over medium-high heat. Cook onion, until softened, 4-5 mins. Add Jerk seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1 min. Stir through coconut milk, water (for the curry) and vegetable stock. Simmer until thickened, 1-2 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/624511c1ee96c91263062672/step-dcd1c10c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, slice lime (see ingredients) into wedges.\n• Stir roast veggies through curry. Remove from heat and add a generous squeeze of lime. Season to taste.\n• Divide rice and curry between bowls. Tear over herbs.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/624511c1ee96c91263062672/step-133cea14.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
